abstract: >-
  An audit of a commercial egocentric video dataset's VLM-derived quality claim:
  asymmetric judge over-calling against 153 single-rater gold frames, worker and
  factory clustering design effects on raw-corpus draws, and gold-corrected
  comparative margins against EPIC-KITCHENS-100. The code and data are
  Apache-2.0, the paper CC BY 4.0.
